# Pairs with FailClosed. lattice_capabilities is served by name to a session
# whose collection does not hold it, so an anonymous caller reaches it.
MODULE: MetaToolServedWithoutAdvertisement
TARGET: FailClosed
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the meta-tool is served whether or not the session's collection holds it
PERTURBS: CallMeta

--- FIND
        res == IF adv THEN "ok" ELSE "notFound"
--- REPLACE
        res == "ok"
--- END
